 "statement": "Left panel of the three-panel 68r foldout (canvas 1006196). Below three lines of text: a face with wavy hair in a circle ringed by small flame- or crescent-shaped ochre marks (upper centre), and at the bottom a face in a circle edged by a yellow crescent and a blue ring, with writing round it. Between them a field of 29 separate ochre stars with seven or eight points, each with a one-word label beside it (all to the right except one); several stars have a small ring at the centre and two a dark dot. A faint large arc partly encloses the field and a faint pale wash lies behind its middle. Choosing the panel: the 29 stars match f68r1's 29 star-label lines (f68r1.8-36); the middle panel's five top text lines match f68r2. Each star carries that block as label_group. Every label sits next to one star, but which line id is which label cannot be fixed without reading the words, so labels are null; each star's position (full-resolution pixel coordinates on the canvas) is given so the pairing can be added later.",
